<ul>
  <li>Submission deadline: April 1 2025, 5pm Pacific Time</li>
  <li>Submission website: <a href="https://llm-dpm25.hotcrp.com/">https://llm-dpm25.hotcrp.com/</a></li>
  <li>Notification of acceptance: April 25, 2025 — delayed to —&gt; May 2, 2025</li>
  <li>Final papers due: May 16, 2025</li>
  <li>Workshop: Sunday, June 22, 2025</li>
</ul>

